# TypeScript

TypeScript is `strict` with `noUncheckedIndexedAccess`. Do not silence it with `as any` or `@ts-ignore`. `no-explicit-any` is off, but a new `any` still needs a reason.

Formatting is Prettier (120 columns, 2 spaces, LF). Run `pnpm lint:prettier` rather than hand-aligning.

Logging uses the pino `logger`. No `console.log`.

Do not write comments unless the code cannot say it: a non-obvious constraint, a workaround and why it exists, or a contract mirrored from outside this repo. Do not narrate the next line. Do not leave commented-out code or TODOs.
